{"format_version":"0.1","record_type":"person_source_bundle","requested_person_id":"cbr-p000672","identity_policy":"contextual_provisional","person_ids":["cbr-p000672"],"persons":[{"id":"cbr-p000672","label":"高陵君顯","status":"active","historicity":"historical_tradition","aliases":[{"surface":"高陵君顯","mention_ids":["c-shiji-007-xiangyu:m008-0094","c-shiji-007-xiangyu:m011-0009"]}],"evidence":[{"mention_id":"c-shiji-007-xiangyu:m008-0094","chapter_id":"c-shiji-007-xiangyu","paragraph_id":"c-shiji-007-xiangyu:p008","quote":"高陵君顯"},{"mention_id":"c-shiji-007-xiangyu:m011-0009","chapter_id":"c-shiji-007-xiangyu","paragraph_id":"c-shiji-007-xiangyu:p011","quote":"高陵君顯"}]}],"mentions":[{"id":"c-shiji-007-xiangyu:m008-0094","start":94,"end":98,"surface":"高陵君顯","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p000672","status":"contextual_provisional","paragraph_id":"c-shiji-007-xiangyu:p008","chapter_id":"c-shiji-007-xiangyu"},{"id":"c-shiji-007-xiangyu:m011-0009","start":9,"end":13,"surface":"高陵君顯","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p000672","status":"contextual_provisional","paragraph_id":"c-shiji-007-xiangyu:p011","chapter_id":"c-shiji-007-xiangyu"}],"relations":[],"title_holdings":[],"address_assertions":[],"date_normalizations":[],"birth_order_constraints":[],"identity_decisions":[],"equivalence_decisions":[],"passages":[{"id":"c-shiji-007-xiangyu:p008","text":"項梁起東阿，西，（北）［比］至定陶，再破秦軍，項羽等又斬李由，益輕秦，有驕色。宋義乃諫項梁曰：「戰勝而將驕卒惰者敗。今卒少惰矣，秦兵日益，臣為君畏之。」項梁弗聽。乃使宋義使於齊。道遇齊使者高陵君顯，曰：「公將見武信君乎？」曰：「然。」曰：「臣論武信君軍必敗。公徐行即免死，疾行則及禍。」秦果悉起兵益章邯，擊楚軍，大破之定陶，項梁死。沛公、項羽去外黃攻陳留，陳留堅守不能下。沛公、項羽相與謀曰：「今項梁軍破，士卒恐。」乃與呂臣軍俱引兵而東。呂臣軍彭城東，項羽軍彭城西，沛公軍碭。","annotation_status":"named_mentions_first_pass","text_layer":"received_chapter","mentions":[{"id":"c-shiji-007-xiangyu:m008-0000","start":0,"end":2,"surface":"項梁","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p000603","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-007-xiangyu:m008-0023","start":23,"end":25,"surface":"項羽","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p000610","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-007-xiangyu:m008-0028","start":28,"end":30,"surface":"李由","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p000670","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-007-xiangyu:m008-0039","start":39,"end":41,"surface":"宋義","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p000671","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-007-xiangyu:m008-0043","start":43,"end":45,"surface":"項梁","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p000603","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-007-xiangyu:m008-0076","start":76,"end":78,"surface":"項梁","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p000603","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-007-xiangyu:m008-0083","start":83,"end":85,"surface":"宋義","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p000671","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-007-xiangyu:m008-0091","start":91,"end":94,"surface":"齊使者","kind":"unresolved","person_id":null,"status":"unresolved","note":"群體、官稱或短稱尚待逐處覆核；不補姓名或推造個別成員。"},{"id":"c-shiji-007-xiangyu:m008-0094","start":94,"end":98,"surface":"高陵君顯","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p000672","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-007-xiangyu:m008-0105","start":105,"end":108,"surface":"武信君","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p000603","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-007-xiangyu:m008-0122","start":122,"end":125,"surface":"武信君","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p000603","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-007-xiangyu:m008-0149","start":149,"end":151,"surface":"章邯","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p000605","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-007-xiangyu:m008-0162","start":162,"end":164,"surface":"項梁","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p000603","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-007-xiangyu:m008-0166","start":166,"end":168,"surface":"沛公","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p000662","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-007-xiangyu:m008-0169","start":169,"end":171,"surface":"項羽","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p000610","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-007-xiangyu:m008-0186","start":186,"end":188,"surface":"沛公","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p000662","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-007-xiangyu:m008-0189","start":189,"end":191,"surface":"項羽","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p000610","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-007-xiangyu:m008-0198","start":198,"end":200,"surface":"項梁","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p000603","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-007-xiangyu:m008-0210","start":210,"end":212,"surface":"呂臣","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p000673","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-007-xiangyu:m008-0219","start":219,"end":221,"surface":"呂臣","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p000673","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-007-xiangyu:m008-0226","start":226,"end":228,"surface":"項羽","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p000610","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-007-xiangyu:m008-0233","start":233,"end":235,"surface":"沛公","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p000662","status":"contextual_provisional"}],"chapter_id":"c-shiji-007-xiangyu","book_id":"b-shiji-007","work_id":"w-shiji","source_id":"s-shiji-007-xiangyu"},{"id":"c-shiji-007-xiangyu:p011","text":"初，宋義所遇齊使者高陵君顯在楚軍，見楚王曰：「宋義論武信君之軍必敗，居數日，軍果敗。兵未戰而先見敗徵，此可謂知兵矣。」王召宋義與計事而大說之，因置以為上將軍，項羽為魯公，為次將，范增為末將，救趙。諸別將皆屬宋義，號為卿子冠軍。行至安陽，留四十六日不進。項羽曰：「吾聞秦軍圍趙王鉅鹿，疾引兵渡河，楚擊其外，趙應其內，破秦軍必矣。」宋義曰：「不然。夫搏牛之蝱不可以破蟣蝨。今秦攻趙，戰勝則兵罷，我承其敝；不勝，則我引兵鼓行而西，必舉秦矣。故不如先鬬秦趙。夫被堅執銳，義不如公；坐而運策，公不如義。」因下令軍中曰：「猛如虎，很如羊，貪如狼，彊不可使者，皆斬之。」乃遣其子宋襄相齊，身送之至無鹽，飲酒高會。天寒大雨，士卒凍飢。項羽曰：「將戮力而攻秦，久留不行。今歲饑民貧，士卒食芋菽，軍無見糧，乃飲酒高會，不引兵渡河因趙食，與趙并力攻秦，乃曰『承其敝』。夫以秦之彊，攻新造之趙，其勢必舉趙。趙舉而秦彊，何敝之承！且國兵新破，王坐不安席，埽境內而專屬於將軍，國家安危，在此一舉。今不恤士卒而徇其私，非社稷之臣。」項羽晨朝上將軍宋義，即其帳中斬宋義頭，出令軍中曰：「宋義與齊謀反楚，楚王陰令羽誅之。」當是時，諸將皆慴服，莫敢枝梧。皆曰：「首立楚者，將軍家也。今將軍誅亂。」乃相與共立羽為假上將軍。使人追宋義子，及之齊，殺之。使桓楚報命於懷王。懷王因使項羽為上將軍，當陽君、蒲將軍皆屬項羽。","annotation_status":"named_mentions_first_pass","text_layer":"received_chapter","mentions":[{"id":"c-shiji-007-xiangyu:m011-0002","start":2,"end":4,"surface":"宋義","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p000671","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-007-xiangyu:m011-0009","start":9,"end":13,"surface":"高陵君顯","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p000672","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-007-xiangyu:m011-0018","start":18,"end":20,"surface":"楚王","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p000682","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-007-xiangyu:m011-0023","start":23,"end":25,"surface":"宋義","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p000671","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-007-xiangyu:m011-0026","start":26,"end":29,"surface":"武信君","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p000603","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-007-xiangyu:m011-0061","start":61,"end":63,"surface":"宋義","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p000671","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-007-xiangyu:m011-0076","start":76,"end":78,"surface":"將軍","kind":"unresolved","person_id":null,"status":"unresolved","note":"群體、官稱或短稱尚待逐處覆核；不補姓名或推造個別成員。"},{"id":"c-shiji-007-xiangyu:m011-0079","start":79,"end":81,"surface":"項羽","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p000610","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-007-xiangyu:m011-0082","start":82,"end":84,"surface":"魯公","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p000610","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-007-xiangyu:m011-0089","start":89,"end":91,"surface":"范增","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p000663","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-007-xiangyu:m011-0098","start":98,"end":101,"surface":"諸別將","kind":"unresolved","person_id":null,"status":"unresolved","note":"群體、官稱或短稱尚待逐處覆核；不補姓名或推造個別成員。"},{"id":"c-shiji-007-xiangyu:m011-0103","start":103,"end":105,"surface":"宋義","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p000671","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-007-xiangyu:m011-0108","start":108,"end":112,"surface":"卿子冠軍","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p000671","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-007-xiangyu:m011-0126","start":126,"end":128,"surface":"項羽","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p000610","stat